  "conflicts": [
    "Schwebender Ring is shown intact as explicitly requested, not as the current construction site. Berlin announced dismantling in June 2024 and planned reopening in 2027: https://www.berlin.de/sen/stadtentwicklung/quartiersentwicklung/staedtebaufoerderung/nachhaltige-erneuerung/aktuell/artikel.1453454.php",
    "Urania OSM building=roof height=0 is a mapped canopy identity, not a measured total height. The open 10m clock is represented with its single column, never an occupied closed building.",
    "Friendship OSM mapped water outline is retained exactly; published 23m includes the outer basin edge. Inner basin, bowl sizes/heights and frieze motifs are procedural recognition proportions, not a per-part survey."
  ],
